<title>USA: Aames sets three-for-two stock split.</title>
<headline>Aames sets three-for-two stock split.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Aames Financial Corp said Wednesday it board of directors have approved a three-for-two split of the company's common stock.</p>
<p>The split is payable on February 21 to stockholders of record as of February 10. Fractional shares will be settled in cash. On a fully diluted basis the company has about 23.8 million shares outstanding.</p>
</text>
